  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>With the ZOLLER »conDress 200« dressing device, you can reliably remove deposits on diamond-coated grinding surfaces and in the spaces between the diamond coating. </p> <p>This restores the removal capacity of your stone processing tools – for permanently efficient grinding processes and precise processing results. Thanks to the robust design and simple operation of the device, cleaning your tools remains safe and efficient. At the same time, you extend the service life of your diamond tools and measurably reduce your tool costs.</p>",
